docs/bad.md:3: construct/chronology: chronology `used to be`: state the standing fact: what is true now. Git holds the history
docs/bad.md:3: construct/hedge: hedge `basically`: decide. A hedge is an unfinished decision
docs/bad.md:3: construct/intensifier: intensifier `very`: delete it. A claim that needs an intensifier is not established
docs/bad.md:3: construct/meta-commentary: meta-commentary `Note that`: state the thing, without an introduction
docs/bad.md:3: construct/status: status `not yet`: state the rule with no qualifier. Whether the artefact exists is not the subject
