docs/bad.md:3: simple/complex-word: complex word `utilize`: write `use`
docs/bad.md:3: simple/contraction: contraction `Don't`: write the full form: `do not`, `it is`
docs/bad.md:3: simple/dash: dash `A - d`: write two sentences, or use a colon or a comma
docs/bad.md:3: simple/emoji: emoji `🚀`: write the meaning in words
docs/bad.md:3: simple/exclamation: exclamation `w!`: delete it
docs/bad.md:3: simple/latin: latin `e.g.`: write `for example`, `that is`, a complete list, or `or`
